  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n(34, 15, 64)\n\n34 + __**15 × 2**__ = 64\n\n__**34 + **____30__ = 64\n\n64 = 64 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(29, 17, 63)\n\n29 + __17 × 2__ = 63\n\n__29 + ____34__ = 63\n\n63 = 63 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 1) (44, 32, 98)\n\n44 + __32 × 2__ = 98\n\n__44 + ____64__ = 98\n\n108 ≠ 98 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) (31, 23, 54)\n\n31 + __25 × 2__ = 54\n\n__31 + ____50__ = 54\n\n81 ≠ 54 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) (25, 14, 53)\n\n25 + __14 × 2__ = 53\n\n__25 + ____28__ = 53\n\n**53 = 53 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) (24, 28, 76)\n\n24 + __28 × 2__ = 76\n\n__24 + ____56__ = 76\n\n70 ≠ 76 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options, '(25, 14, 53)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
